msgid "AC Agent"
msgstr "AC 纳管"

msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

msgid "Shows whether this access point is under controller management, and how it reaches the controller."
msgstr "显示本接入点是否处于控制器管理之下，以及它通过何种方式连到控制器。"

msgid "Control status"
msgstr "纳管状态"

msgid "Managed"
msgstr "已纳管"

msgid "Connected, awaiting adoption"
msgstr "已连接，等待采纳"

msgid "Controller unreachable"
msgstr "控制器不可达"

msgid "No controller found"
msgstr "未发现控制器"

msgid "Starting"
msgstr "启动中"

msgid "Agent not responding"
msgstr "agent 无响应"

msgid "Agent stopped"
msgstr "agent 未运行"

msgid "This access point is running a revision issued by controller %s."
msgstr "本接入点正在运行控制器 %s 下发的配置版本。"

msgid "This access point is running a revision issued by the controller."
msgstr "本接入点正在运行控制器下发的配置版本。"

msgid "The controller answers but has not adopted this access point yet. Adopt it in the controller interface; until then no configuration is pushed."
msgstr "控制器有应答，但尚未采纳本接入点。请在控制器界面完成采纳，在此之前不会下发任何配置。"

msgid "Last error: %s"
msgstr "最近错误：%s"

msgid "The configured address does not answer."
msgstr "已配置的地址没有应答。"

msgid "No controller address is configured and no UDP answer arrived on the local segment. A controller behind a router never sees the broadcast, so enter its address above."
msgstr "既没有配置控制器地址，也没有收到本地网段的 UDP 应答。路由器另一侧的控制器收不到广播，请在上方直接填写它的地址。"

msgid "The agent has not updated its status for more than three heartbeats. Check the process; a restart usually recovers it."
msgstr "agent 已超过三个心跳周期没有更新状态。请检查进程，通常重启即可恢复。"

msgid "The agent process is not running, so this access point is not under any controller."
msgstr "agent 进程未运行，本接入点当前不受任何控制器管理。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

msgid "configured address"
msgstr "手动配置的地址"

msgid "discovered by broadcast"
msgstr "广播发现"

msgid "Controller ID"
msgstr "控制器 ID"

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置版本"

msgid "nothing applied yet"
msgstr "尚未下发"

msgid "rev %d applied, rev %d pending"
msgstr "已生效 rev %d，待应用 rev %d"

msgid "rev %d"
msgstr "rev %d"

msgid "Last heartbeat"
msgstr "最近心跳"

msgid "(accepted)"
msgstr "（已被接受）"

msgid "(failed)"
msgstr "（失败）"

msgid "Access point"
msgstr "接入点"

msgid "BSS reported"
msgstr "上报 BSS 数"

msgid "Agent"
msgstr "agent"

msgid "since"
msgstr "启动于"

msgid "Last apply error: %s"
msgstr "最近一次应用失败：%s"

msgid "Restart agent"
msgstr "重启 agent"

msgid "Agent restarted."
msgstr "agent 已重启。"

msgid "Could not restart the agent: %s"
msgstr "无法重启 agent：%s"

msgid "One cycle finished (exit code %d)."
msgstr "已完成一次同步（退出码 %d）。"

msgid "Could not run the agent: %s"
msgstr "无法运行 agent：%s"

msgid "Controller connection"
msgstr "控制器连接"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Starts the agent, enables it at boot, and opens TCP 8090 plus UDP 29820/29821 on the WAN zone, so an AC on the upstream or LAN side can discover and manage this access point during initial setup. On by default."
msgstr "启动 agent 并设为开机自启，同时在 WAN 防火墙上放行 TCP 8090 与 UDP 29820/29821，便于初始化时被上游或 LAN 侧的 AC 发现并纳管。默认开启。"

msgid "Controller address"
msgstr "控制器地址"

msgid "host:port of the controller. Leave empty to find the controller by UDP broadcast on the local segment; once it answers, the discovered address is filled in here and can be saved to pin it. A controller on the other side of a router must be entered explicitly, because broadcast never crosses layer 3."
msgstr "控制器的 host:port。留空则通过本地网段的 UDP 广播自动发现；控制器应答后，发现的地址会自动填入此处，保存即可固定。路由器另一侧的控制器收不到广播，必须在此明确填写。"

msgid "Shared secret"
msgstr "共享密钥"

msgid "Must match AC_SHARED_SECRET on the controller. Leave empty when the controller does not check one."
msgstr "必须与控制器上的 AC_SHARED_SECRET 一致。控制器不校验时留空。"

msgid "Heartbeat interval"
msgstr "心跳间隔"

msgid "Seconds between two polls. The default is 20."
msgstr "两次轮询之间的秒数，缺省 20。"

msgid "Peer coordination port"
msgstr "AP 间协同端口"

msgid "UDP port used to exchange 802.11k data between access points directly. 0 disables it."
msgstr "AP 之间直接交换 802.11k 数据所用的 UDP 端口。填 0 表示关闭。"

msgid "Peer announcement interval"
msgstr "AP 间播报间隔"

msgid "How often this access point announces its BSS and client state to its peers, for example 30s."
msgstr "本接入点向邻居播报自身 BSS 与客户端状态的间隔，例如 30s。"

msgid "Peer coordination network"
msgstr "AP 间协同网络"

msgid "Logical OpenWrt network, for example lan, that carries AP-to-AP traffic. The agent resolves its l3_device and joins IPv6 link-local multicast on it; when IPv6 is unavailable it falls back to IPv4 broadcast."
msgstr "承载 AP 间流量的 OpenWrt 逻辑网络名，例如 lan。agent 会解析它的 l3_device 并加入 IPv6 link-local 组播；IPv6 不可用时自动回退 IPv4 广播。"

msgid "Peer shared secret"
msgstr "AP 间共享密钥"

msgid "Shared by every access point and used to authenticate peer messages with HMAC-SHA256. Leave empty only on a trusted management segment; never reuse AC_SHARED_SECRET."
msgstr "所有接入点共用，用于对 AP 间报文做 HMAC-SHA256 认证。仅在可信管理网段可留空；不要复用 AC_SHARED_SECRET。"

msgid "Local roam suggestion"
msgstr "本地漫游建议"

msgid "Let the agent itself send one 802.11v transition suggestion (BTM) when a client is very weak and a peer serves the same SSID. This is built into the agent, needs no steering daemon, and is on by default so roaming keeps working across any number of access points after the controller is lost. It stays silent whenever usteer or dawn is enabled; nrsyncd only distributes 11k neighbour lists and does not compete."
msgstr "当客户端信号极弱且邻居提供同名 SSID 时，由 agent 自己向客户端发送一条 802.11v 切换建议（BTM）。这是 agent 自带能力，不依赖任何引导守护进程，且默认开启：控制器失联后，任意数量的接入点之间仍可继续协同并自行建议漫游。仅在 usteer/dawn 启用时保持沉默；nrsyncd 只分发 11k 邻居表，不会冲突。"

msgid "Settings saved. The agent and the WAN rules now follow the switch."
msgstr "设置已保存。agent 与 WAN 放行规则已按开关生效。"

msgid "Settings saved. The agent restarts to pick them up."
msgstr "设置已保存。agent 将重启以应用新配置。"

msgid "Could not save the settings: %s"
msgstr "无法保存设置：%s"

msgid "Save & apply"
msgstr "保存并应用"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "复位"

msgid "The controller no longer knows this access point, but rev %d is still running here. Adopt it again to resume management."
msgstr "控制器已不再记录本接入点，但本机仍在运行 rev %d。重新采纳即可恢复管理。"

msgid "Roaming steering"
msgstr "漫游引导"

msgid "agent"
msgstr "agent"

msgid "running %s"
msgstr "正在运行 %s"
